"The <strong>%(periodo)s</strong> report card has not been published by your "
"school yet."

msgid ""
"Se habilita una vez que el colegio cierra el periodo y publica los "
"boletines. Te avisaremos por correo cuando esté listo para consultar y "
"descargar."
msgstr ""
"It becomes available once the school closes the term and publishes the "
"report cards. We will notify you by email when it is ready to view and "
"download."

msgid "Volver a mi panel"
